        "location": "longterm-mem/cmd/longterm-mem/cmd_mcp.go:144-156",
        "claim": "A nil *memorycard.Store is passed to newEngramSource when no memorycard database exists. The same pattern appears in cmd_promote.go and cmd_sync.go. If newEngramSource takes an interface for the lineage reader, this is a typed-nil non-nil interface, and a lineage lookup would panic on a machine without memorycard. The diff does not show newEngramSource, so this cannot be confirmed. The tests only pass an untyped nil (engram.NewSource(store, nil)), so this path is untested.",
